{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dog is attracted by the bones and runs into a maze! You have to go in to find it and collect the bones on the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, this maze is not as simple as it seems. You may suddenly get into a whole new dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362790/extras/SteamGIF_002.gif?t=1742109665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dog would like to jump, run and play with you! Find it quickly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362790/extras/SteamGIF_003.gif?t=1742109665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful hand-painted art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ordinary but brainwashing music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weird puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 2 hours play time (But if you like, you can pass and collect all in 30 minutes!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space, dimension, the theme that interests you most!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Green Bones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362790/8f1bc224eed564466df5a301af181dc1939773a6.jpg"},{"name":"Orange Bones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362790/8bbd48a00d8f3cd452066cda5ac8203eb99c900a.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Bones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362790/d35d0440341a0ceb41005656a919b8098d1ef4a6.jpg"},{"name":"Red Bones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362790/abb24018ca5a5500bea47f39577ea4aa2e0af3b5.jpg"},{"name":"Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362790/b7319fbeb0e5296b1f